<title>UK: EIB sets 10 bln peseta five-year Matador bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 10 bln peseta five-year Matador bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Banco Central Hispanoamericano.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN PTA    COUPON     6.125     MATURITY    15.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE   MATADOR	 ISS PRICE  101.14    PAY DATE    15.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    MADRID    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.00	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
